'''Tyranitar''' (Japanese: '''バンギラス''' ''Bangiras'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

