===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Tyranitar|85}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Buster Tail''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Goodra|197}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

